  "name": "Grant Application",
  "description": "Take grant requests online: applicant organization, project summary, amount requested, budget, outcomes and supporting documents.",
  "category": "Nonprofit",
  "seoTitle": "Free Grant Application Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Grant application form template for funders. Collects applicant organization, project summary, amount requested, timeline, budget, outcomes and attachments.",
